{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذْ", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "said"}, {"text": "إِبْرَٰهِـۧمُ", "translation": "Ibrahim"}, {"text": "رَبِّ", "translation": "My Lord"}, {"text": "ٱجْعَلْ", "translation": "make"}, {"text": "هَـٰذَا", "translation": "this"}, {"text": "بَلَدًا", "translation": "a city"}, {"text": "ءَامِنًۭا", "translation": "secure"}, {"text": "وَٱرْزُقْ", "translation": "and provide"}, {"text": "أَهْلَهُۥ", "translation": "its people"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "with"}, {"text": "ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ", "translation": "fruits"}, {"text": "مَنْ", "translation": "(to) whoever"}, {"text": "ءَامَنَ", "translation": "believed"}, {"text": "مِنْهُم", "translation": "from them"}, {"text": "بِٱللَّهِ", "translation": "in Allah"}, {"text": "وَٱلْيَوْمِ", "translation": "and the Day"}, {"text": "ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ ۖ", "translation": "the Last"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "He said"}, {"text": "وَمَن", "translation": "And whoever"}, {"text": "كَفَرَ", "translation": "disbelieved"}, {"text": "فَأُمَتِّعُهُۥ", "translation": "[then] I will grant him enjoyment"}, {"text": "قَلِيلًۭا", "translation": "a little"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "then"}, {"text": "أَضْطَرُّهُۥٓ", "translation": "I will force him"}, {"text": "إِلَىٰ", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "عَذَابِ", "translation": "(the) punishment"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّارِ ۖ", "translation": "(of) the Fire"}, {"text": "وَبِئْسَ", "translation": "and evil"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَصِيرُ", "translation": "(is) the destination"}], "sahih": "And [mention] when Abraham said, \"My Lord, make this a secure city and provide its people with fruits - whoever of them believes in Allāh and the Last Day.\" [Allāh] said, \"And whoever disbelieves - I will grant him enjoyment for a little; then I will force him to the punishment of the Fire, and wretched is the destination.\""}